{"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"Getting Started with OUDS","role":"article","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_unified_ds.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_unified_ds.png"}],"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"Welcome to Orange Unified Design System"}]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Tokens","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Themes","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Components","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Modules"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Integrate OUDS","level":2,"anchor":"Integrate-OUDS"},{"type":"heading","text":"Use Swift Package Manager","level":3,"anchor":"Use-Swift-Package-Manager"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to add the iOS library of ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Unified Design System","type":"text"}]},{"text":", you need to add our ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"text":" into your project.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do that, add a new ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"package dependency","type":"text"}]},{"text":" to your ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode"}]},{"text":" project by refering to it by ","type":"text"},{"code":"github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You are free to choose whether or not you want a branch or a specific tag, pick the solution you want."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds"},{"text":" for more details about versions, releases and tags. You can find release tags (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") and release candidates tags (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0-rc3"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"text":"Import the libraries you need","anchor":"Import-the-libraries-you-need","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You should use one (or several) of the following imports for your needs, which are basically "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" products."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"tip","name":"Tip","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"We recommend to embed in your apps only the ones you need to avoid to embed useless assets.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"code":["import OUDSThemesContract \/\/ If you want to define your theme, use themes or OUDSThemeableView","import OUDSModules \/\/ To use modules","import OUDSComponents \/\/ To use components","import OUDSThemesOrange \/\/ To use the default Orange theme","import OUDSThemesOrangeCompact \/\/ To use the Orange Compact theme","import OUDSThemesSosh \/\/ To use the Sosh theme","import OUDSThemesWireframe \/\/ To use the Wireframe theme","import OUDSTokensComponent \/\/ If you need to override or use directly components tokens","import OUDSTokenSemantic \/\/ If you need to override or use directly semantic tokens","import OUDSTokensRaw \/\/ If you need to override or use directly raw tokens","import OUDSFoundations \/\/ For some utilities"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"text":"Or more simple, import umbrella library","anchor":"Or-more-simple-import-umbrella-library","type":"heading"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We do not recommend this solution because from our point of view use of tailored imports is better to import only the needed elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use of umbrella products can increase app sizes and needed storage because it emebds plenty of assets (images, fonts, etc.)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and useless constants."}]}],"type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Import the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" product which suits your needs:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Umbrella"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUI"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All libraries listed above and all themes"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUIOrange","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All libraries listed above but with only Orange and Orange Compact themes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUIWireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All libraries listed above but with only Wireframe theme"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUIOrangeSosh"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All libraries listed above but with only Orange and Sosh themes","type":"text"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"anchor":"Chose-your-theme","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Chose your theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Unified Design System","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" framework provides today four themes:"}]},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Theme","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default one for Orange products and can be enriched \/ derivated"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Compact"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For some Orange products with heavy \/ rich UI and dimensions constraints","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For Sosh products","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For mockups, prototypes and prooves of concepts witouth Orange-flavoured styles","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"anchor":"Apply-a-theme","level":3,"text":"Apply a theme","type":"heading"},{"columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You will need to use for your application root view the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/oudsthemeableview\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/themes","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" also."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This special view is here to define some elements as environment variables and injects the choosen theme."}]}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","       WindowGroup {","          OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","          }","       }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"numberOfColumns":2,"type":"row"},{"type":"row","columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then get the current applied theme in your views and use the tokens you want."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The tokens are wrapped in providers with clear names, you only need to choose the ones you want."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Use it in views as an environment variable","@Environment(\\.theme) var theme"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"numberOfColumns":2},{"type":"aside","style":"tip","name":"Tip","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep in mind only one theme can be used within one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"text":"Trick for Xcode Preview","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Trick-for-Xcode-Preview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you use Xcode "},{"code":"#Preview","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" blocks, you will have to be sure the theme is instanciated and injected through the "},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because it is not possible today to override the legit "},{"code":"#Preview","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block, you can instead use some of our utilities to wrap your content","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"inside the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":" automatically. These utilities come with the themes modules. Without them you may face errors about undefined theme."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Apply Orange theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .orangePreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Orange Compact theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .orangeCompactPreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Sosh theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .soshPreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Wireframe theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .wireframePreview()","}"]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/GettingStarted"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How to add the package as dependency, import libraries and use theme and components for your apps."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"ic_component_intro.png":{"alt":null,"identifier":"ic_component_intro.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/ic_component_intro.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/Components":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Components","abstract":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components"}]},{"type":"text","text":" are the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" objects you can add in the views of your apps, like buttons, links, cards etc."}],"images":[{"identifier":"ic_component_intro.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_component_intro.png","type":"card"}],"title":"Components","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/components","role":"article"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/Tokens":{"abstract":[{"text":"Design tokens represent the small, repeated design decisions that make up a design system’s visual style. Tokens wrap hard-coded static values, such as hexadecimal codes for color, with self-explanatory names. They are used to define the look and feel and the style of everything. They are exposed through the themes and can be used 